# Moxes cast on turn 1 let Gray enter on turn 3. On turn 5 Opt satisfies the intervening condition and Gray copies itself;
# Bot2 Stifles the delayed sacrifice at turn 5's end step, leaving the token into turn 7, where its end-of-turn haste is gone
# (CR 603.4, 603.7b, 702.10b, 611.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Gray and Adira, Forever Joined
Opt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Stifle
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
